    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the heart of our gaming community on Discord and unlock a treasure trove of rewards! Join now and embark on a thrilling journey to score epic loot and dominate the leaderboard. </p></p><br><h1>Free Weekend</h1><p>&quot;Prepare for adrenaline-pumping action in the skies with Sky Carnage: Aerial Anarchy!<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Take to the skies in high-speed airplanes.<br>\ud83c\udfaf Unleash devastating firepower on your rivals.<br>\ud83c\udf0e Explore stunning, immersive landscapes.<br>\ud83d\udca3 Engage in heart-pounding aerial battles.<br><br>Experience the ultimate airplane racer shooting game that will leave you breathless. Dominate the skies, obliterate your opponents, and become the ultimate flying ace.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Join the battle in Sky Carnage: Aerial Anarchy now and rewrite the rules of aerial combat!&quot;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Airplanes Dogfight Racer&quot;, an exciting air racing and battle game where winning is all about conquering the skies! Compete against other airplanes as enemies while completing the race and engaging in intense dogfights. With 5 different weapons to choose from, you can use your machine gun, missiles, mines, shield, and repair kits to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/411038020af162fc26a4001b63acb71c.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/411038020af162fc26a4001b63acb71c.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/411038020af162fc26a4001b63acb71c.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features alternative routes that offer strategic advantages, making the air race even more thrilling. Choose from three gameplay modes - Championship, Arcade, and Time Trial - and test your skills in solo or multiplayer split-screen modes. The game's difficulty levels, ranging from easy to hard, make it a perfect fit for both novice and expert players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Five Heart-Pounding Race Tracks &amp; 8 High-Flying Airplanes Await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With five different tracks to unlock, as well as a garage where you can purchase eight different types of airplanes, &quot;Sky Carnage: Aerial Anarchy&quot; offers endless hours of entertainment. The unlock system allows you to unlock new items and tracks as you progress, keeping the game fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/def162419c3e9938b1bc374a4c3c47b0.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/def162419c3e9938b1bc374a4c3c47b0.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/def162419c3e9938b1bc374a4c3c47b0.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features Made Easy: Fly Planes, Boosters, Enemies, Weapons, and Local Leaderboards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's features include an airplane controller, booster cooldown system, enemy AI, and a dogfight system with five weapons. With a local leaderboard, you can compete with your friends and local rivals for the top spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/cec6d9797b1943a6adc3d88b09f2eebc.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/cec6d9797b1943a6adc3d88b09f2eebc.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/cec6d9797b1943a6adc3d88b09f2eebc.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also includes a countdown system, which adds to the excitement and adrenaline rush. With all these amazing features, &quot;Sky Carnage: Aerial Anarchy&quot; is a game that you can't afford to miss. So, what are you waiting for? Download the game now and soar to victory in the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Airplanes Dogfight Racer&quot;, an exciting air racing and battle game where winning is all about conquering the skies! Compete against other airplanes as enemies while completing the race and engaging in intense dogfights. With 5 different weapons to choose from, you can use your machine gun, missiles, mines, shield, and repair kits to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/411038020af162fc26a4001b63acb71c.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/411038020af162fc26a4001b63acb71c.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/411038020af162fc26a4001b63acb71c.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features alternative routes that offer strategic advantages, making the air race even more thrilling. Choose from three gameplay modes - Championship, Arcade, and Time Trial - and test your skills in solo or multiplayer split-screen modes. The game's difficulty levels, ranging from easy to hard, make it a perfect fit for both novice and expert players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Five Heart-Pounding Race Tracks &amp; 8 High-Flying Airplanes Await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With five different tracks to unlock, as well as a garage where you can purchase eight different types of airplanes, &quot;Sky Carnage: Aerial Anarchy&quot; offers endless hours of entertainment. The unlock system allows you to unlock new items and tracks as you progress, keeping the game fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/def162419c3e9938b1bc374a4c3c47b0.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/def162419c3e9938b1bc374a4c3c47b0.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/def162419c3e9938b1bc374a4c3c47b0.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features Made Easy: Fly Planes, Boosters, Enemies, Weapons, and Local Leaderboards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's features include an airplane controller, booster cooldown system, enemy AI, and a dogfight system with five weapons. With a local leaderboard, you can compete with your friends and local rivals for the top spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/cec6d9797b1943a6adc3d88b09f2eebc.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/cec6d9797b1943a6adc3d88b09f2eebc.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/cec6d9797b1943a6adc3d88b09f2eebc.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also includes a countdown system, which adds to the excitement and adrenaline rush. With all these amazing features, &quot;Sky Carnage: Aerial Anarchy&quot; is a game that you can't afford to miss. So, what are you waiting for? Download the game now and soar to victory in the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.poster.avif?t=1727849191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.webm?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778040/extras/c0608e72f97c492d44964cbca5699768.mp4?t=1727849191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
